__pycache__/
*.pyc
.venv/
venv/
dist/
*.egg-info/
.pytest_cache/
.ruff_cache/
dist/
tools/ui-smoke/pwenv/
frontend-v2/node_modules/
# raggity's index directory. `raggity serve`/`ingest` creates it in the CWD when
# no config points elsewhere, so running the RAG sidecar from a checkout drops a
# LanceDB index here. It is derived data — never source.
.raggity/

# Working notes. Everything under `docs/` is written for the author rather than
# for the distribution, so only the one guide that ships is tracked.
#
# `docs/*` rather than `docs/` so that guide can be re-included below: a file
# inside an excluded DIRECTORY cannot be re-included, no matter what the negation
# says.
docs/*
# The agent-integration guide is user-facing documentation — shipped in the wheel
# and pointed at from the legacy UI (`src/rigma/data/ui/panels.js` says "see
# docs/AGENTS.md"), so removing it would ship a dead pointer.
!docs/AGENTS.md

# Scratch space and downloaded reference material. The second is other people's
# source, kept only to re-check a claim against the revision it cites — not ours
# to redistribute, and reproducible from the URLs the notes carry.
.scratch/
_research/
